#### **3. docs.api Special Handling**

**docs.api goes through both:**
- [docs/scripts/build-api-locales.ts](docs/scripts/build-api-locales.ts) (called by `docs:api:locales`)
- [docs/scripts/build-api-en.ts](docs/scripts/build-api-en.ts) (called by `docs:api:en`)

**build-api-locales.ts — refreshApiPot()** (lines 246–264):
```typescript
const refreshApiPot = (): void => {
  const units = globSync("**/*.md", { cwd: enApiDir })
    .sort()
    .flatMap((file) =>
      collectUnits(segmentMarkdown(readFileSync(join(enApiDir, file), "utf8")))
        .filter(isCatalogedApiUnit)
        .map((unit) => ({
          msgid: unit.text,
          msgctxt: `docs.api:${unit.kind}`,
          reference: relative(enApiDir, join(enApiDir, file)),
          translate: "always" as const,
        })),
    );
  writeFileSync(join(repoRoot, "l10n", "docs.api.pot"), serializePot(units, ["no-c-format"]));  // ← REGENERATES
  refreshCoverageReports(join(repoRoot, "i18n.config.json"));
};
```
**Called at line 497** in the build orchestration:
```typescript
generateBaseApiDocs();
refreshApiPot();
```
✅ **Regenerates l10n/docs.api.pot before building locales.**

**build-api-en.ts** (line 52):
```typescript
writeFileSync(join(apiRoot, "../../l10n/docs.api.pot"), serializePot(units, ["no-c-format"]));
```
✅ **Also regenerates l10n/docs.api.pot** as part of `docs:api:en` chain.

