#### **4. What Regenerates docs.* POTs?**

**docs.guides:**
- [docs/scripts/translate-guide-po.ts](docs/scripts/translate-guide-po.ts) **calls `runExtractGuides(config, repoRoot)` at line 21** ✅ Regenerates `l10n/docs.guides.pot`

**docs.home:**
- [docs/scripts/sync-home-locales.ts](docs/scripts/sync-home-locales.ts) **calls `runExtractContent(config, repoRoot, "docs.home")` at line 13** ✅ Regenerates `l10n/docs.home.pot`

**docs.chrome:**
- [docs/scripts/translate-chrome-po.ts](docs/scripts/translate-chrome-po.ts) — **NO `runExtractMessages()` call** ❌ **POT never regenerated**
- Only reads and merges existing `l10n/{locale}/docs.chrome.po` against possibly-stale POT

**docs.demos:**
- [docs/scripts/translate-demo-po.ts](docs/scripts/translate-demo-po.ts) — **NO `runExtractMessages()` call** ❌ **POT never regenerated**
- Only reads and merges existing `l10n/{locale}/docs.demos.po` against possibly-stale POT

**docs.api:**
- `docs:api:locales` via build-api-locales.ts calls `refreshApiPot()` ✅
- `docs:api:en` via build-api-en.ts regenerates POT ✅

