**Sets environment variable `DOCS_TRANSLATION_FORCE=1`** — but no docs scripts inspect this variable. Searched [docs/scripts/translate-guide-po.ts](docs/scripts/translate-guide-po.ts), [docs/scripts/translate-chrome-po.ts](docs/scripts/translate-chrome-po.ts), [docs/scripts/translate-demo-po.ts](docs/scripts/translate-demo-po.ts), [docs/scripts/build-api-locales.ts](docs/scripts/build-api-locales.ts) — **none reference `DOCS_TRANSLATION_FORCE`**.

❌ **force environment variable is set but never used.**

